==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|stagnant||lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|stagnans||lang=la}}, present participle of {{term|stagno||lang=la|to form a pool of standing water}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Lacking [[freshness]], [[motion]], [[flow]], [[progress]], or [[change]]; [[stale]]; [[motionless]]; [[still]].

